  "caveats": [
    "The verified July 2026 LTA map includes the three CCL6 stations; LTA announced passenger opening on 2026-07-12.",
    "TEL5 and DTL3e are marked under construction on that map. No precise passenger opening date was located in the primary sources checked on 2026-09-15. TE30, TE31, DT36 and DT37 remain explicitly excluded pending confirmation; the as_of field is the review date, not a claim of continuously verified service status.",
    "CE2 and CE1 are accepted legacy aliases for CC33 Marina Bay and CC34 Bayfront respectively. They do not add physical stations or line memberships.",
    "MRT interchanges share one physical LED. Nearby stations that require leaving the paid area remain separate unless LTA designates them as one named interchange; Newton, Tampines and Bukit Panjang follow the official interchange grouping.",
    "LRT codes and stops are outside this MRT-only inventory, including LRT aliases at Choa Chu Kang, Bukit Panjang, Sengkang and Punggol.",
    "No geographic coordinates are claimed. line_paths encodes schematic adjacency, not train service patterns, operational routing, journey times or track geometry."
  ],
